<li id="mwmQ">Identification and isolation of the major positive regulator of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Meiosis" title="Meiosis" id="mwmg">meiosis</a>.<sup about="#mwt70" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-22" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-22"}}'><a href="./Alexander_Silberman_Institute_of_Life_Sciences#cite_note-22" id="mwmw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwnA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwnQ">[</span>22<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwng">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
